W: Schneeglöckchen (snowdrop) cf. Schnee (snow), Glocke (bell) - Glöckchen (little bell)
W:-CHEN is a common diminutive ending, in Swissgerman it is -LI (Glöggli - little bell, Hüsli - little house, Geissli – little goat etc.)
